   "lines": [
    "Thanks[?] fortune,",
    "all the hard work",
    "for this spring",
    "is over.",
    "Very often,",
    "when I have",
    "done well in",
    "something, I find",
    "my self thinking",
    "\"How pleased",
    "Father will be!\"",
    "It seems perfectly",
    "terrible some times",
    "to think of never",
    "seeing him again;",
    "I long for him",
    "so."
   ],
